OL,3,GNEWSA'My sister is missing since
OL,4,ANepal's flash floods'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman says she has not been able to
OL,7,Fcontact her sister who was near the
OL,8,FNepal-Tibet border when devastating
OL,9,Fflash flooding hit.
OL,11,FNepalese authorities reported at least
OL,12,F389 people have died and more than 900
OL,13,Fare missing, including 33 UK tourists,
OL,14,Ffollowing the natural disaster on
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,17,FIn Tibet, at least 558 people are
OL,18,Fmissing, with three confirmed dead, but
OL,19,Fit is unclear if these figures overlap
OL,20,Fwith Nepal's.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
