OL,3,GNEWSA'My sister is missing since
OL,4,ANepal's flash floods'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTatajana Phillips, from Folkestone in
OL,7,FKent, said the last known location of
OL,8,Fher sister Julija Jakovicka was in the
OL,9,Fborder area an hour before the flash
OL,10,Ffloods struck.
